    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "fold.rs is a private module of view.rs. Its one test module is mod tests. Add the new test function at the end of that module, before its closing brace. Do not write a second mod tests. Change only line_indent. Trim the start with [' ', '\\t', '\\u{00A0}']. When that trimmed body is empty, the line is blank. Do not change leading_indent. Do not add U+2000 or U+3000. Do not nest an if inside an if. Do not write two if arms that return the same value. Combine them with ||. That is clippy::if_same_then_else. Do not touch fold_at or indent_folds. The existing test a_whitespace_line_does_not_end_a_fold stays green. Do not rewrite its assertions. The test a_no_break_space_line_stays_inside_the_fold checks indent_folds of a, newline, two spaces, b, newline, U+00A0, newline, e with tab width 4. The spans equal indent_folds of the same text with a normal space in place of U+00A0. That span is FoldSpan { start: 0, end: 3 }. Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip. Keep the change under about 60 lines. Stay inside this one behavior. Run the full test module named in the commands, not only the new test."
  },
